{
  "id": "弱水",
  "name": "弱水",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [
    "弱之水"
  ],
  "type": "river",
  "typeConfidence": "high",
  "description": "水名，名叫弱水的河流很多。古人也把浅而不能载舟的水流称为弱水",
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-10-13",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "水名，名叫弱水的河流很多。古人也把浅而不能载舟的水流称为弱水"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-10-13",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "窫窳龙首，居弱水中，在狌狌知人名之西，其状如龙"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-10-14",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，其木若，其名曰建木。在窫窳西弱水上。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-15",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "水名，具体所指待考"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-15",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "弱水、青水出西南隅，以东，又北，又"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "soushenji-01-24",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "汉间，呼吸发九嶷。流汝不稽路，弱水何不之。”出薯蓣子三枚，大如鸡"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西南注南海丹泽之东。赤水之东，弱水出自穷石，至于合黎，余波入于流"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-07-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "之际，径蹑都广，人日抑节，羽翼弱水，暮宿风穴，当此之时，鸿鹄鸧鸖"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "shanhaijing",
    "chapterIndex": 10
  }
}
